    /// Verify that evaluation keys are consistent with a secret key.
    ///
    /// This is a key-owner diagnostic for bundle construction. It checks that relinearization
    /// entries decrypt to the expected scaled `s^2` residues, Galois entries decrypt to the
    /// expected scaled automorphed-secret residues, and every public refresh ciphertext decrypts to
    /// zero. The residual for key-switch entries must stay in the current deterministic
