/// alternate Norito framing before returning the package object, so callers do not accidentally
/// accept package bytes that differ from the bytes used by the canonical package digest.
///
/// # Errors
/// Returns [`BfvError`] when `bytes` is empty, all-zero, not a release-audit package, malformed, or
/// not the canonical v1 Norito encoding of the decoded package.
