/// Return exact residual bounds for the executable full-bootstrap prefix trace.
///
/// The helper validates the governed full-bootstrap key and artifact bundle, then composes
/// coefficient-to-slot, blind-rotation, raw sample extraction, diagnostic coefficient-zero repack,
